<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 580.98, off 1.03.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 285 to 236.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.03.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 24,809,300, compared with 26,620,425 Friday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
